    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίζω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκριξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					5.50
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: aor. 2 and pf. (v. infr.):—
				<i>creak</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίκε ζυγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.470
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>screech</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ Ἰλλυριοὶ κεκριγότες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1521
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαιτύπη κρίζει τις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					879
				</span></i>
			; in 
				Boeot.
			, <i>laugh</i>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριδδέμεν</span>
			. (Onomatop.)</div>
